      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Half the people complaining about the MUTE text complained about it being distracting due to pulsing. The big bright red circle is visible enough to indicate that you're muted, no need to pulse it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-07-16T05:55:04.029Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The idea, I presume was to make it more obvious when the user is muted. \nThe thing about this is that not only is there a new animation for muting your microphone, but it is already incredibly obvious that you're muted due to the fact that the mic icon goes from an outline of a circle, to entirely filled in.\nI believe that the flashing only serves to be distracting, and that the mute icon should not pulse.\nIf the pulsing was intended to prevent screen burn in, it may be nicer to just play the animation, leave the icon on screen for a few second, and then fade the microphone icon out entirely. This is not only more immersive, even with the UI turned on, but also serves to show the user that \"Your microphone isn't active, therefor it does not show.\"",
